st.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["तवीषः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["tavIzaH"]}, {"id": "tAviza", "headword": "ताविष", "headword_slp1": "tAviza", "fold": "tavisa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": "ताविष m. (-षः)\n 1. Svarga or paradise.\n 2. The ocean.\n f. (-षी) The daugh-\nter of INDRA.\n 2. A river.\n 3. The earth.\n E. तव a Sautra root, Uṇādi\naffix टिषच्; also read तविष, तवीष, &c.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["ताविषः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["tAvizaH"]}], "tavakina": [{"id": "tAvakIna", "headword": "तावकीन", "headword_slp1": "tAvakIna", "fold": "tavakina", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": "तावकीन mfn. (-नः-ना-नं) Thine.\n E. तवक for तव thine, and खञ् aff. तव इदं\nयुध्मद् + खञ् एकवचने तवकादेशः ।", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["तावकीनं"], "synonyms_slp1": ["tAvakInaM"]}], "tavat": [{"id": "tAvat", "headword": "तावत्", "headword_slp1": "tAvat", "fold": "tavat", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": "तावत् mfn. (-वान्-वती-वत्)\n 1. So many, as many, as much.\n 2. All. ind.\nSo much, so far, so many, unto, until, the correlative to यावत्. E.\nतत् that, then, and डावत् affix: see यावत्.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["तावन्त्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["tAvant"]}], "tavatika": [{"id": "tAvatika", "headword": "तावतिक", "headword_slp1": "tAvatika", "fold": "tavatika", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": "तावतिक mfn. (-कः-का-कं) Of so much, worth so much, &c. see the next.\nE. तावता क्रीतः संख्यात्वात् कन् वतोरिड् वा पा० वा इट् ।", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "tavatka": [{"id": "tAvatka", "headword": "तावत्क", "headword_slp1": "tAvatka", "fold": "tavatka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "shabda-sagara", "senses": [{"gloss": "तावत्क mfn. (-त्कः-त्का-त्कं) Of so much, bought for so much, &c.\n E. कन्\nadded to तावत्; also with इट् inserted तावतिक.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "tav